      <title>Tony Bennett</title>
      <link>https://www.columbiarecords.com/2023/07/21/tony-bennett/</link>
      <description>Columbia Records is saddened by the loss of Tony Bennett. He will forever be a cornerstone of our history and the Columbia Records family. Tony’s eternal voice, charm, warmth, soul, and spirit changed the world and brightened the lives of millions over the course of his 73-year career. Our thoughts and prayers are with his family, friends, and the countless fans worldwide who love him.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.columbiarecords.com/2023/07/21/tony-bennett/</guid>
